  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p><strong>• Brand introduction:</strong><br>Dreamroo is a woman, veteran, and minority-owned brand on a mission to simplify everyday life with thoughtfully designed kitchen and feeding essentials. We're here to support busy parents and mindful homemakers with non-toxic, durable, and beautiful alternatives to plastic.</p><p><strong>• Product description:</strong><br>Our collection includes premium silicone food storage containers, bento boxes, suction plates, bowls with lids, baby bibs, travel utensil sets, placemats, and more. All products are made to be safe, easy to clean, and stylish enough for everyday use.</p><p><strong>• USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong><br>Dreamroo products are non-toxic, BPA-free, and made from high-quality silicone. Designed with families in mind, they’re oven-safe, dishwasher-safe, microwave-safe, and built to last. Functional, sustainable, and thoughtfully curated.</p><p><strong>• Payment terms:</strong><br>Affiliates earn 10% commission on every sale made through their unique link or discount code. Payouts are processed monthly via PayPal.</p><p><strong>• Other information:</strong><br>We welcome creators, parents, and everyday product lovers who value quality, safety, and sustainability. Affiliates get access to promotional materials, early product launches, and the chance to grow with a brand that’s building a supportive, inclusive community.</p></div></div>",
